<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-044" chapter-id="c-jinshu-044-lufu" source-id="s-jinshu-044-lufu">
  <p id="c-jinshu-044-lufu:line050" annotation-status="pending" text-layer="received_chapter">浮字子雲，起家太子舍人。病疽截手，遂廢。然朝廷器重之，以為國子博士、祭酒、秘書監，皆不就。</p>
</text>
